 ow=b628cdfa (Recommended) OR www.netroadshow.com\; Entry Code: BEACONDEBT2
 6 (not case-sensitive)\n\nDeal context:\nBeacon Point DC LLC\, an indirect
  subsidiary of Hut 8 Corp.\, has mandated J.P. Morgan and Goldman Sachs & 
 Co. LLC to arrange a series of fixed income investor calls ahead of a pote
 ntial Rule 144A/Reg S offering\, with ratings to follow from Moody's. The 
 issuer is developing a 352 MW hyperscale data center in Nueces County\, Te
 xas\, 100% leased to a high-investment-grade tenant (rated AA- or higher) 
 under a 15-year triple-net lease structure with three 5-year extension opt
 ions\, providing strong credit support. The deal is at the Mandate stage w
 ith no size\, tenor\, or pricing terms disclosed\; investor calls are sche
 duled across June 2nd and 3rd\, 2026\, accompanied by a draft preliminary 
 offering memorandum and pre-recorded investor presentation.
